{
  "name": "veed worrking version",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "🎬 VEED AI Video Generator",
        "formDescription": "Fill in the details below — your talking video will be generated automatically and emailed to you!",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "What is this video about?",
              "placeholder": "e.g. How to automate your marketing workflow with VEED and n8n"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Avatar Image URL",
              "placeholder": "https://your-image-url.com/photo.jpg (public, front-facing portrait)"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Your Email Address",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "placeholder": "you@example.com"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Script Tone",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "High-Energy & Hype"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Professional & Authoritative"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Conversational & Relatable"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Storytelling / Emotional Hook"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Voice Style",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "alloy"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "nova"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "shimmer"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "echo"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "onyx"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -2864,
        160
      ],
      "id": "c76375cf-b772-4073-8fc6-55393aaccf3f",
      "name": "Enter Video Topic",
      "notes": "STEP 1 — Fill in all 5 fields:\n• Topic: what the video is about\n• Avatar Image URL: any public image URL (Unsplash, Imgur, Google, etc.)\n• Email: where to deliver the finished video\n• Script Tone: style of the ad script\n• Voice Style: the AI voice that reads the script\n\nThe image will be automatically downloaded and re-hosted — any URL works!"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a world-class direct-response copywriter who specializes in viral Instagram Reels ads.\n\nYour task: Write a jaw-dropping 30-second spoken ad script for: {{ $json['What is this video about?'] }}\n\nTone: {{ $json['Script Tone'] }}\n\nSTRUCTURE (follow exactly):\n1. HOOK (first 3 seconds) — Start with a bold, provocative or curiosity-driven opening line. Make the viewer STOP scrolling instantly.\n   - Bold claim: \"Most [target audience] are wasting X doing Y — here's the fix.\"\n   - Curiosity gap: \"Nobody talks about this, but it's the reason you're [problem].\"\n   - Direct challenge: \"If you're still doing [old way], you're leaving money on the table.\"\n\n2. PROBLEM AGITATION (5 seconds) — Quickly twist the knife. Remind them of the pain, the frustration, the wasted time.\n\n3. SOLUTION REVEAL (10 seconds) — Introduce the product/solution as the obvious answer. Be specific. Mention saving time, automating their workflow, and the transformation it delivers.\n\n4. PROOF / CREDIBILITY (5 seconds) — One punchy line of social proof, a result, or a bold outcome promise.\n\n5. CALL TO ACTION (5 seconds) — Single, urgent, crystal-clear CTA. Create FOMO. Use action words.\n\nRULES:\n- Under 80 words total — tight, punchy, no fluff\n- Written exactly as it will be SPOKEN — natural rhythm, no jargon\n- NO stage directions, scene descriptions, or formatting\n- NO emojis or symbols\n- Speak directly to marketers and creators who want to grow faster\n- Every sentence must earn its place — if it doesn't hook, agitate, or convert, cut it\n- Plain text only",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -2656,
        160
      ],
      "id": "21c37520-330f-48c0-8057-bfd0925b5dce",
      "name": "Generate Ad Script",
      "notes": "5-part Instagram ad framework: Hook > Problem > Solution > Proof > CTA\nAdapts tone from form. Outputs clean plain text ready for the critique pass."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -2704,
        384
      ],
      "id": "21c2d848-8473-4cf1-915e-e1747e929547",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a brutal but brilliant creative director reviewing an Instagram Reels ad script.\n\nHere is the script to review:\n{{ $('Generate Ad Script').item.json.output }}\n\nYour job:\n1. Identify the 1-2 weakest lines (too generic, too slow, or missing punch)\n2. Rewrite the ENTIRE script incorporating those fixes — tighter hook, sharper CTA, same structure\n3. Keep it under 80 words\n4. Plain text only — no labels, no formatting, no explanation\n5. Output the FINAL improved script only — nothing else",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -2320,
        160
      ],
      "id": "dd9ab083-001e-4b4a-9e19-7737a571c198",
      "name": "Self-Critique & Rewrite Script",
      "notes": "QUALITY PASS — Reviews the first draft and rewrites weak lines before sending to TTS.\nSame OpenAI model reused — no extra cost."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -2464,
        368
      ],
      "id": "0268ae3c-0e64-415a-9b02-2699096d8e90",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "audio",
        "input": "={{ $('Self-Critique & Rewrite Script').item.json.output }}",
        "voice": "={{ $('Enter Video Topic').item.json['Voice Style'] }}",
