      "notes": "THE STAR OF THE SHOW\n\nVEED Fabric 1.0 generates a realistic lip-synced talking video from the portrait + audio.\n\n• Resolution: 720p\n• Aspect Ratio: 9:16 (perfect for Instagram Reels)\n• Credential: fal.ai API key (free tier at fal.ai)\n\nRendering takes 2-3 minutes — the Wait node handles this."
